---
pagination:
  data: categoryPages
  size: 1
  alias: cp
permalink: "{{ cp.slug }}.html"
layout: base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ cp.titleNat }}"
  description: "{{ cp.descNat }}"
  permalinkPath: "{{ cp.slug }}.html"
extraHead: |
  <style>
    .cat-page-intro { padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 12px; }
    .cat-page-intro p { max-width: 72ch; }
    .cat-page-intro h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--heading); margin-top: 1.6em; }
    .cat-page-jump { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 18px 0 8px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .cat-page-jump a { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--ink),0.15); border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--encre); }
    .cat-page-jump a:hover { border-color: var(--terracotta); color: var(--terracotta); }
    .cat-page-region { padding-top: 24px; }
    .cat-page-region > h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--heading); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .cat-page-region .cat-grid { margin: 16px 0 8px; }
    .cat-page-dept { margin: 24px 0 8px; scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
    .cat-page-dept h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--heading); }
    .cat-page-dept h3 .count { font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(var(--ink),0.6); }
  </style>
---
{%- set catDepts = collections.categoryDepts | whereEq("cat", cp.cat) %}
{%- set total = collections.fiches | countCategoryPage(cp) %}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ catDepts | catDeptItems(cp) | listJsonLd([{ name: "Coco Explore", path: "" }, { name: cp.label, path: cp.slug }], cp.h1Nat) | safe }}</script>
<section class="wrap cat-page-intro">
  <span class="tag">{{ cp.tag }}</span>
  <h1>{{ cp.h1Nat }}</h1>
  <p>{{ cp.introNat | fill({ total: total, nbDeps: catDepts.length }) | safe }}</p>

  {%- if cp.nearby %}
  <div class="nearby-box" id="nearby-box">
    <h2>Les {{ cp.unit[1] }} les plus proches de toi</h2>
    <p>Autorise la localisation : on t'affiche les {{ cp.unit[1] }} les plus proches, avec la distance à vol d'oiseau. Ta position reste sur ton téléphone, elle n'est envoyée nulle part.</p>
    <button type="button" class="map-filter map-filter-all" id="nearby-btn">Me localiser</button>
    <p class="nearby-status" id="nearby-status" role="status"></p>
    <ol class="nearby-list" id="nearby-list" hidden></ol>
  </div>
  <script>window.COCO_NEARBY=[
  {%- for fiche in collections.fiches | inCategoryPage(cp) %}{"u":{{ ("/" + (fiche.data.permalinkPath | cleanUrl)) | dump | safe }},"t":{{ fiche.data.h1 | dump | safe }},"l":{{ fiche.data.lieu | dump | safe }},"a":{{ fiche.data.lat }},"o":{{ fiche.data.lng }}},{% endfor -%}
  ];</script>
  <script src="/geoloc.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/nearby.js" defer></script>
  {%- endif %}

  <h2>{{ cp.howTitle }}</h2>
  <p>{{ cp.howHtml | safe }}</p>

  <h2>Trouver par département</h2>
  <ul class="cat-page-jump">
    {%- for dep in catDepts | sort(false, false, "nom") %}
    <li><a href="{% if dep.hasPage %}/{{ cp.slug }}-{{ dep.slug }}{% else %}#{{ cp.slug }}-{{ dep.slug }}{% endif %}">{{ dep.nom }} ({{ dep.fiches.length }})</a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{%- if cp.faq %}
<section class="wrap cat-page-intro">
  <h2>Questions fréquentes</h2>
  {%- for item in cp.faq %}
  <h3>{{ item.q }}</h3>
  <p>{{ item.a }}</p>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": cp.faq | faqEntities} | dump | safe }}</script>
{%- endif %}


{%- for region in regions %}
{%- set regionDepts = catDepts | whereEq("region", region.nom) %}
{%- if regionDepts.length %}
<section class="wrap cat-page-region">
  <h2>{{ region.nom }}</h2>
  {%- set withPage = regionDepts | whereEq("hasPage", true) %}
  {%- if withPage.length %}
  <div class="cat-grid">
    {%- for dep in withPage %}
    <a href="/{{ cp.slug }}-{{ dep.slug }}" class="cat-card">
      <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>
      <h3>{{ dep.nom }}</h3>
      <span class="count">{{ dep.fiches.length }} {{ cp.unit[1] }}</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- for dep in regionDepts | whereEq("hasPage", false) %}
  <div class="cat-page-dept" id="{{ cp.slug }}-{{ dep.slug }}">
    <h3>{{ cp.label }} {{ dep.enNom }} <span class="count">({{ dep.fiches.length }} {{ cp.unit[1] if dep.fiches.length > 1 else cp.unit[0] }})</span></h3>
    <div class="fiche-grid">
      {%- for fiche in dep.fiches %}
      {% include "fiche-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

<section class="wrap cat-page-intro">
  <h2>Une adresse manque à l'appel ?</h2>
  <p>Le guide s'enrichit en continu. Si tu connais une adresse qui n'est pas encore référencée, ou si une information a changé (tarif, horaires, fermeture), <a href="/contact">écris-nous</a> : on vérifie et on met la fiche à jour.</p>
</section>
